---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const description = 'Learn about Sora Files, a free private browser-based toolkit for compressing, converting, merging, and splitting PDF and image files.';
const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'AboutPage',
  name: 'About Sora Files',
  url: 'https://sorafiles.com/about',
  description,
  mainEntity: { '@type': 'WebApplication', name: 'Sora Files', url: 'https://sorafiles.com/', applicationCategory: 'UtilitiesApplication', isAccessibleForFree: true },
};
---

<Layout title="About Sora Files | Free Private PDF & Image Tools" {description} canonicalPath="/about" {schema}>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="grid-surface relative overflow-hidden border-b border-line px-5 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
      <div class="soft-noise pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-semibold text-blue">About Sora Files</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-balance text-[clamp(2.25rem,5.5vw,3.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.05em]">Useful file tools should respect the files you trust them with.</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-lg leading-8 text-muted">Sora Files is a free browser-based toolkit for everyday PDF, image, HEIC, and Word tasks. Its available workflows are designed to run locally, with clear limitations and no unnecessary account step.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="mission-heading" class="px-5 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]">
        <div><p class="eyebrow text-xs font-semibold text-violet">Our purpose</p><h2 id="mission-heading" class="mt-3 text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] sm:text-4xl">Make routine file work simpler and more private.</h2></div>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-muted">
          <p>Sora Files was created around a simple idea: routine file work should be useful without asking people to hand over their documents. File utilities are often needed at inconvenient moments, so the website puts common jobs in a consistent interface that explains what will happen before processing begins.</p>
          <p>Supported files are processed with browser APIs and open-source engines downloaded as website code. Your document content remains on your device throughout the workflow. The original file is never overwritten, and every result is created as a separate download.</p>
          <p>Some conversions involve unavoidable trade-offs. PDF compression can flatten interactive document structure, and text-first Word conversions may simplify advanced layouts. Sora Files presents those limits plainly so you can choose the right tool and keep an appropriate original.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="principles-heading" class="border-y border-line bg-canvas px-5 py-20 sm:px-6">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <h2 id="principles-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em]">What Guides the Product</h2>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="bg-surface p-7"><h3 class="font-semibold">Local by default</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Available tools avoid sending selected files to a processing server.</p></article>
          <article class="bg-surface p-7"><h3 class="font-semibold">Clarity before action</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Important format changes and fidelity limits appear before you create an output.</p></article>
          <article class="bg-surface p-7"><h3 class="font-semibold">Useful without friction</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Core tools work without an account, watermark, or artificial download step.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-5 py-16 sm:px-6"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Have a Question or Suggestion?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Read how to contact Sora Files and what details help us respond.</p></div><a href="/contact" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-control bg-action px-5 text-sm font-medium text-action-contrast hover:bg-action-hover">Contact Us</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
